   "morning_observation": "Tuesday, February 2, 2016. The local radio plays three bright notes and announces a groundhog forecast in the town square. A delivery van backfires twice.",
   "episodes_in_order": [
    "6:00 am in inn: June reaches the square. Ellis says: Morning, June. I'm heading to the studio to file the 7 AM weather segment. See you there. Ellis leaves the inn. You see Cal at the square.",
    "9:30 am in square: June inspects the square. The band is setting up. Cal says: I'm holding my position here for now, watching the setup. Cal spends the period at the square.",
    "1:00 pm in square: June records the town band on its afternoon stand. Cal says: June, hold on, I'm listening to the band. Cal stays for the band's cornet solo. June invites Cal on the crew radio to contribute to the evening slot."
   ]
  },
